# Culling: what's sent (polygons, vertices) vs what SGL shows (displayed), per view.
wait 15.5
# Speed 20, drive north to the wall (~6.6 s), turn east to run along it
press c 13
wait 7
press right
wait 1.5
# Iso, running along the north wall: walls ahead and behind, trail behind
shot cull_1_iso
# 1st person: the wall on the left, the trail behind (out of view)
press down
wait 1
shot cull_2_1st
# Full zig-zag trail: the worst case, in 1st person then iso
press x
wait 0.5
shot cull_3_1st_zigzag
press down
wait 0.5
shot cull_4_iso_zigzag
